    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out our next cozy game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/5af33c38713d9a56e1d93d0aa43ab355.avif?t=1727815132\" width=644 height=177 /></span>Watermelon Suika Game also known as the Watermelon Game, is a casual and addictive game where the goal is to stack and combine fruits of different sizes to create larger watermelons. The game mechanics resemble a &quot;match-3&quot; style, but with a fun twist where the fruits fall and roll across the screen with dynamic physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/945604759fa9e6435c4e84a130df3853.poster.avif?t=1727815132\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/945604759fa9e6435c4e84a130df3853.webm?t=1727815132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/945604759fa9e6435c4e84a130df3853.mp4?t=1727815132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, fruits appear at the top of the screen and fall randomly. When two fruits of the same type touch, they merge to form a larger fruit. For example, two cherries combine to form a grape, two grapes combine to form a peach, and so on, until they form a watermelon. The challenge lies in managing the growing stack of fruits without letting them overflow the game area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/90a75d7538a4ff8e199438d9df4dee24.poster.avif?t=1727815132\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/90a75d7538a4ff8e199438d9df4dee24.webm?t=1727815132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/90a75d7538a4ff8e199438d9df4dee24.mp4?t=1727815132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suika Game has gained popularity for its simple and relaxing gameplay, becoming a hit among players looking for a light and fun pastime. Now available on Steam, the game is perfect for those seeking a casual and engaging experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out our next cozy game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/5af33c38713d9a56e1d93d0aa43ab355.avif?t=1727815132\" width=644 height=177 /></span>Watermelon Suika Game also known as the Watermelon Game, is a casual and addictive game where the goal is to stack and combine fruits of different sizes to create larger watermelons. The game mechanics resemble a &quot;match-3&quot; style, but with a fun twist where the fruits fall and roll across the screen with dynamic physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/945604759fa9e6435c4e84a130df3853.poster.avif?t=1727815132\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/945604759fa9e6435c4e84a130df3853.webm?t=1727815132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/945604759fa9e6435c4e84a130df3853.mp4?t=1727815132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, fruits appear at the top of the screen and fall randomly. When two fruits of the same type touch, they merge to form a larger fruit. For example, two cherries combine to form a grape, two grapes combine to form a peach, and so on, until they form a watermelon. The challenge lies in managing the growing stack of fruits without letting them overflow the game area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/90a75d7538a4ff8e199438d9df4dee24.poster.avif?t=1727815132\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/90a75d7538a4ff8e199438d9df4dee24.webm?t=1727815132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722740/extras/90a75d7538a4ff8e199438d9df4dee24.mp4?t=1727815132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suika Game has gained popularity for its simple and relaxing gameplay, becoming a hit among players looking for a light and fun pastime. Now available on Steam, the game is perfect for those seeking a casual and engaging experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a puzzle adventure to prevent fruit overflow! Strategically collide fruits, crafting colossal watermelons. Join this exciting challenge of combining matching fruits to conquer the leaderboard and master the art of creating giant watermelons.",
